  "historyNote": "#6519-B, eff 5-29-97 (from Env-A 402.03); ss by #7788, eff 10-31-02; ss by #8330, eff 4-23-05; ss by #10415, eff 9-24-13 (from Env-A 1607.01); ss by #13808, eff 11-18-23",
